---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="CyLMaterna - Tu embarazo, más cerca">
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-28">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l4.553 2.276A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7" />
            </svg>
            Datos abiertos de Castilla y León
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-fg mb-6 leading-tight">
            Tu embarazo,<br /><span class="text-primary">más cerca</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
            Descubre los recursos sanitarios y territoriales que tienes cerca durante tu embarazo en Castilla y León.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <a href="/donde-vive" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-dark text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
              Descubrir mi zona
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#como-funciona" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-transparent border-2 border-primary/30 text-primary hover:bg-primary/5 font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
              Cómo funciona
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-12 sm:pb-16" aria-labelledby="guias-embarazo-title">
      <h2 id="guias-embarazo-title" class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg text-center mb-6">Guía de ayuda durante el embarazo</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div>
      <a href="/mi-embarazo#signos-sintomas-alarma" class="group block h-full bg-card border-2 border-primary/20 rounded-xl p-5 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 focus-visible:border-primary">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86l-8.1 14a2 2 0 001.73 3h16.16a2 2 0 001.73-3l-8.1-14a2 2 0 00-3.46 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 id="signos-sintomas-alarma-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-fg">Signos y síntomas de alarma</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Consulta las señales de alarma y cuándo debes acudir al hospital durante el embarazo.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-primary font-medium mt-4">Leer la información completa</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      </div>

      <div>
      <a href="/mi-embarazo#atencion-embarazo" class="group block h-full bg-card border-2 border-secondary/20 rounded-xl p-5 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-secondary/50 focus-visible:border-secondary">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-light flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-3-3v6m8-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 id="atencion-embarazo-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-fg">Atención y seguimiento del embarazo</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-secondary transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Conoce las consultas, controles y ecografías que forman parte del seguimiento del embarazo.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-secondary font-medium mt-4">Leer la información completa</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      </div>

      <div>
      <a href="/mi-embarazo#site" class="group block h-full bg-card border-2 border-primary/20 rounded-xl p-5 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 focus-visible:border-primary">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.228 9.247a4.75 4.75 0 117.544 0M12 14v.01M12 18h.01M5.636 5.636l-.707-.707m14.142.707l.707-.707M12 2v1" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 id="site-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-fg">¿Has estado en contacto con sustancias peligrosas o factores de riesgo?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Conoce el Servicio de Información Telefónica para la Embarazada (SITE) y cómo resolver tus dudas.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-primary font-medium mt-4">Consultar el servicio SITE</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      </div>
      <div>
      <a href="/mi-embarazo#alimentacion-segura" class="group block h-full bg-card border-2 border-secondary/20 rounded-xl p-5 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-secondary/50 focus-visible:border-secondary">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-light flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v18m-6-6h12M6 9h12M8 5l4-2 4 2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 id="alimentacion-segura-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-fg">Alimentación segura durante el embarazo</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-secondary transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Consejos sencillos sobre higiene, alimentos seguros y nutrición.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-secondary font-medium mt-4">Consultar la guía</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <a href="/recursos-cerca" class="group block bg-card border-2 border-primary/20 rounded-xl p-5 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 focus-visible:border-primary">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18zm0 0v-4m0-10V3m9 9h-4M7 12H3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-fg">Recursos cerca de ti</h3>
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Un directorio colaborativo de asociaciones, grupos y servicios de apoyo durante el embarazo.</p>
              <span class="inline-block text-primary font-medium mt-4">Explorar y proponer recursos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-bg-subtle border border-border rounded-xl px-4 py-3">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Información oficial sobre salud materno-infantil</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-0.5">Recursos de la Junta de Castilla y León</p>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.saludcastillayleon.es/es/protege-salud/salud-materno-infantil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-primary-dark no-underline focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-3 rounded">
          Consultar información
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
          </svg>
          <span class="sr-only">(se abre en una nueva pestaña)</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="como-funciona" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg text-center mb-4">Cómo funciona</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-center mb-12 max-w-lg mx-auto">En tres pasos sencillos descubres tu entorno sanitario.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">01</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg mb-2">Dónde vives</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Selecciona tu municipio y la app identifica tu zona sanitaria automáticamente.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">02</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg mb-2">Conoce tu zona</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Tu Zona Básica de Salud, centro de salud, consultorios y recursos cercanos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">03</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg mb-2">Descubre tus recursos</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Farmacias, hospitales, transporte y atención urgente en tu territorio.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-border bg-bg-subtle">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg mb-6">Sobre el proyecto</h2>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Vivir un embarazo en una zona rural puede significar tener que desplazarse para acceder a determinados servicios.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            <strong class="text-fg">CyLMaterna</strong> reúne información pública para ayudarte a conocer mejor tu entorno sanitario durante el embarazo en Castilla y León.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary-light text-secondary rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            Información de datos abiertos. No sustituye el consejo médico.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg mb-4">Empieza ahora</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">Introduce tu municipio y descubre todo lo que necesitas saber.</p>
        <a href="/donde-vive" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-dark text-white font-medium px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
          Descubrir mi zona
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
